{"suttaId":"tha-ap474","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1561,1626],"vripara":"8"},"segments":{"tha-ap474:0.3":"Maṇipūjakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap474:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","tha-ap474:1.3":"Vivekakāmo sambuddho, gacchate anilañjase.","tha-ap474:2.1":"“Avidūre himavantassa, mahājātassaro ahu;","tha-ap474:2.3":"Tattha me bhavanaṃ āsi, puññakammena saṃyutaṃ.","tha-ap474:3.1":"“Bhavanā abhinikkhamma, addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap474:3.3":"Indīvaraṃva jalitaṃ, ādittaṃva hutāsanaṃ.","tha-ap474:4.1":"“Vicinaṃ naddasaṃ pupphaṃ, pūjayissanti nāyakaṃ;","tha-ap474:4.3":"Sakaṃ cittaṃ pasādetvā, avandiṃ satthuno ahaṃ.","tha-ap474:5.1":"“Mama sīse maṇiṃ gayha, pūjayiṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap474:5.3":"Imāya maṇipūjāya, vipāko hotu bhaddako.","tha-ap474:6.1":"“Padumuttaro lokavidū, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;","tha-ap474:6.3":"Antalikkhe ṭhito satthā, imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsatha.","tha-ap474:7.1":"‘So te ijjhatu saṅkappo, labhassu vipulaṃ sukhaṃ;","tha-ap474:7.3":"Imāya maṇipūjāya, anubhohi mahāyasaṃ’.","tha-ap474:8.1":"“Idaṃ vatvāna bhagavā, jalajuttamanāmako;","tha-ap474:8.3":"Agamāsi buddhaseṭṭho, yattha cittaṃ paṇīhitaṃ.","tha-ap474:9.1":"“Saṭṭhikappāni devindo, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap474:9.3":"Anekasatakkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ.","tha-ap474:10.1":"“Pubbakammaṃ sarantassa, devabhūtassa me sato;","tha-ap474:10.3":"Maṇi nibbattate mayhaṃ, ālokakaraṇo mamaṃ.","tha-ap474:11.1":"“Chaḷasītisahassāni, nāriyo me pariggahā;","tha-ap474:11.3":"Vicittavatthābharaṇā, āmukkamaṇikuṇḍalā [āmuttamaṇikuṇḍalā (sī. syā. pī.)].","tha-ap474:12.1":"“Aḷārapamhā hasulā, susaññā tanumajjhimā;","tha-ap474:12.3":"Parivārenti maṃ niccaṃ, maṇipūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap474:13.1":"“Soṇṇamayā maṇimayā, lohitaṅgamayā tathā;","tha-ap474:13.3":"Bhaṇḍā me sukatā honti, yadicchasi [yadicchāya (sī. pī.)] piḷandhanā.","tha-ap474:14.1":"“Kūṭāgārā gahārammā, sayanañca mahārahaṃ;","tha-ap474:14.3":"Mama saṅkappamaññāya, nibbattanti yadicchakaṃ.","tha-ap474:15.1":"“Lābhā tesaṃ suladdhañca, ye labhanti upassutiṃ;","tha-ap474:15.3":"Puññakkhettaṃ manussānaṃ, osadhaṃ sabbapāṇinaṃ.","tha-ap474:16.1":"“Mayhampi sukataṃ kammaṃ, yohaṃ adakkhi nāyakaṃ;","tha-ap474:16.3":"Vinipātā pamuttomhi, pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ.","tha-ap474:17.1":"“Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","tha-ap474:17.3":"Divasañceva rattiñca [samantā sattaratanā (sī. pī. ka.)], āloko hoti me sadā.","tha-ap474:18.1":"“Tāyeva maṇipūjāya, anubhotvāna sampadā;","tha-ap474:18.3":"Ñāṇāloko mayā diṭṭho, pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ.","tha-ap474:19.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ maṇiṃ abhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap474:19.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, maṇipūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap474:20.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap474:21.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap474:22.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap474:23.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā maṇipūjako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap474:24.1":"Maṇipūjakattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
